Z||000004||Sage||05-30-2000||01:17 AM||||Nice pics!  The horse and buggy looks like post card material! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  The wife and I were just up around Middleburg a couple weeks ago and saw quite a bit of the Amish countryside and "folk".  Saw a very nice red coupe while at an eatery off of Rt#39; was preceeded and followed by...you guessed it, horse and buggy!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000005||fiero56||05-30-2000||08:01 AM||||Those pictures are great! Several years ago I lived VERY close to amish country, and every morning I could look out my window and see hills, green grass, farm animals, etc. Very beautiful part of the state. Now I look out and see my neighbor putting a new flat of flowers in the ground. Plus there are no hills or country roads very close either.||||reg||1
Z||000006||2M4 Dale||05-30-2000||11:57 AM||||These pics were taken near Mt. Hope, Ohio. And, even though, I have a Mansfield address I live way out in the country and have Amish nieghbors.<P>This was a neat tour. First we met up and cruised to an Amish school and were treated to a day in the life of an Amish school child by an ex-Amish school teacher. Then we cruised to the Amish farm for a tour of an Amish house, barn and grounds. At the farm we ate a home cooked meal, including fresh baked pies. We also got to take buggy rides and pet thier tame deer...lol. After that we cruised to Berlin, Oh for some shopping. Lots of antiques and Amish crafts. (Guys don't take your wifes here without a full wallet...lol) We had real nice day !||||reg||14
Z||000007||Sage||05-30-2000||03:47 PM||||We went through Berlin on the way home.  Stopped and ate there, and visited the flea market.  You're right about the full wallet thing!  Did get some good deals on small hand tools though. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000008||Shiner||05-30-2000||04:50 PM||||Did anybody see "When The Amish Attack: Part 3" last night??  They might act all nice and simple, but those Amish are murdering bastards!  ||||reg||1
